  "interpretation": "The pinned path reaches the isolated-mode CPU tracker wait from a page-table unmap push while uvm_va_block_unmap asserts that va_block->lock is held. A GPU command whose completion requires UVM fault service on the same block could be unable to make progress until that lock is released. The patch also adds a distinct pageable-migration wait on zero_tracker before the copy push; the inspected pageable VMA path rejects NVIDIA UVM-owned VMAs, but this audit does not prove that all callers avoid holding other progress-critical locks. These are lock-context risks, not proof of a deadlock or runtime observations. Do not load-test this mode until each wait has a source-backed progress argument and a targeted fault/concurrency stress test.",
